WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.599
Typing a return into tax software means answering question after question,

00:00:07.599 --> 00:00:11.700
in an order you don't choose, and wondering where each figure was.

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:14.745
Every number, traced to its page.

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:16.321
Start on the page.

00:00:16.321 --> 00:00:18.385
The to-do list shows what's due,

00:00:18.385 --> 00:00:21.610
and the moves show what could still lower the tax.

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:28.514
The entry sheet lists everything your tax software will ask,

00:00:28.514 --> 00:00:29.911
in the order it asks.

00:00:29.911 --> 00:00:34.770
Under each form, each value shows the document and page it was read from.

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:39.276
Each row is ready, an estimate, or missing.

00:00:39.276 --> 00:00:43.036
A missing row names the command that fills it, and names,

00:00:43.036 --> 00:00:47.390
Social Security numbers and bank numbers are left for you to type.
